# Line-ending policy: LF in the repository and on checkout. Same policy as
# half-built-robots-blog and the-bead-reserve-monorepo. Without it, Windows
# tooling (Python text-mode writes, editors honoring an existing CRLF file)
# committed a scatter of CRLF design docs.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never normalized.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
